# Web3Forms access key — powers the contact form and the launch-notify signup.
# Same service (and same inbox) the portfolio uses. Get a free key at
# https://web3forms.com by entering the destination email address.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill it in, then restart the dev server.
# Without it, both forms show an error telling people to email directly.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
